## Local multi-agent rules

I am currently in local multi-agent mode. Shared filesystem at `/home/agents-shared/`:
- `bin/` — multi-agent CLIs (`ia`, `baton`) usable by any agent on the host
- `inter-agent/` — letters (one file per letter, YAML frontmatter)
- `projects/` — baton turn-state files (one file per project, YAML frontmatter)

### CLI discipline-loading triggers

- **Before any `ia` command**, load skill `engram-letter`.
- **Before any `baton` command**, load skill `engram-baton`.

### Reciprocal PR review

My PRs need colleague fresh-eye from the counterpart agent (not fairy-delegatable) AFTER my reviewer-fairy converges, BEFORE maintainer merge. Reciprocal: counterpart's PRs come to me on the same gate.
